        "part_id": "PT1",
        "statement": "Comparison of English EQ-5D source versions showed differences in wordings, headings, font styles and qualifiers across the adult 3L, adult 5L, EQ-5D-Y-3L and EQ-5D-Y-5L that must be considered when translating.",
