      {
        "type": "Finding",
        "id": "F2",
        "study_id": "S1",
        "part_id": "PT1",
        "statement": "In the Bahasa Indonesia versions, levels 1, 2 and 4 of the EQ-5D-Y-5L matched levels 1, 2 and 3 of the EQ-5D-Y-3L, instead of levels 1, 3 and 4 as in the English versions, because the EQ-5D-3L Bahasa Indonesia lacks a level 2 magnitude qualifier.",
